From ffe89cfa8409bac316b964ac7fc547d91171895d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Zhirun Liu <zhirunliu@aicsemi.com>
Date: Sat, 29 Aug 2026 16:21:05 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 150/247] FROMLIST(v4): wifi: aic: add FullMAC WLAN driver

Add the cfg80211 FullMAC implementation, TX/RX data paths, SDIO host glue and
AIC8800D80 U02 chip operations.  Normal Wi-Fi control is exposed through
cfg80211/nl80211 and system suspend is handled through the SDIO dev_pm_ops.

The Android private ioctl, Wireless Extensions, GKI shim, vendor-HAL stubs,
Bluetooth character device and bridge extension present in earlier RFCs are
not included.

Signed-off-by: Zhirun Liu <zhirunliu@aicsemi.com>
Signed-off-by: Yanli Yang <yanli.yang@bedmex.com>
